      "extract": "arXiv:hep-th/0205308v2 29 May 2006 FIAN/TD-07/02 ITEP/TH-25/02 EMPG-02-12 WDVV Equations as Functional Relations H.W. Braden1 and A. Marshakov2 We discuss the associativity or WDVV equations and demonstrate that they can be rewritten as certain functional relations between the second deriva- tives of a single function, similar to the dispersionless Hirota equations. The properties of these functional relations are",
